{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1524441600, "end_date": 1525132799, "month_true_total": 1175, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:21 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41783261", "author": {"steamid": "76561198251112406", "personaname": "Yukio Kouri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198251112406/", "num_games_owned": 366, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 47536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19554, "last_played": 1705305151, "avatar": "14d9085e230044858e335275f4a2daaec64def54"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ever just want a game you can play. And have hours of a good time on. Just want that game where you can play and be just as good as the rest with out buying that DLC or Lootbox system. Well look no further. Warframe is honestly an awsome game. I recomend any one give it a try. Dont look at this as your casual F2P cause your 100% wrong. This game should not be a F2P honestly its to good for us poor people. Space ninjas where can you go wrong? You love hacking and slashing a crap load of mobs you love superish powers? Shooting a bunch of stuff to pieces? This has got it all. Remember if you enjoy this game buy a little plat to support the devs not cuase you have to but so this game can keep delivering :)", "timestamp_created": 1525129211, "timestamp_updated": 1525129211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.444444417953491211", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41781931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062341196", "personaname": "Ketteräkurina", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kettera